# --- Presentation Tier (React/Vite) ---
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/.env
**/.env.local
frontend/npm-debug.log*

# --- Logic Tier (Java/Spark) ---
# Ignore compiled classes and JARs
**/*.class
**/*.jar
**/*.war

# If using Maven or Gradle
**/target/
**/.gradle/
**/build/

# IDE specific files
**/.settings/
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.idea/
**/*.iml
**/.vscode/

# --- Data Tier & System ---
# Ignore OS-generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Ignore any local SQL dumps
*.sql.gz
*.backup